+### Windows smoke check: no visible optimizer windows
+
+Run on a Windows machine with the installed build and a prompt optimizer (headroom or RTK) on `PATH`:
+
+1. `ta daemon restart`, then start a goal with `ta run "smoke test"`.
+2. Watch the desktop for two minutes. No console window may open or flash for the optimizer.
+3. Kill the optimizer process from Task Manager. The supervisor restarts it after a backoff. Again, no window may appear.
+4. Kill it five times within five minutes. `ta compression status` must show `suspended`, a `Last failure:` line, and the optimizer must not come back until `ta compression enable`.
+
+A window at any step blocks the release: the spawn flag in `prompt_optimizer_supervisor.rs` (`CREATE_NO_WINDOW`) is not taking effect. CI cannot see this, because the flag is only passed to the OS on Windows.
+
